  <wpt lat="35.920000" lon="-121.465000">
    <ele>62.0</ele>
    <name>12km INFO Regent's Slide - reopened, monitored</name>
    <desc>The slide that closed Big Sur for two years. Highway 1 reopened here on 14 January 2026, about 90 days early, after an $82 million repair. Caltrans calls the slope stable and monitors it continuously (prisms, accelerometer arrays, inclinometers, drone survey, piezometers). This is why the ride is possible at all in 2026 - and why you check QuickMap before departing anyway. Position approximate. SRC gov.ca.gov 14 Jan 2026 / Caltrans D5</desc>
    <sym>Flag, Blue</sym>
    <type>info</type>
  </wpt>
