    <name>257km INFO Gaviota Tunnel - bicycles ARE allowed</name>
    <desc>US-101 through Gaviota Pass. Bicycles are allowed through the Gaviota Tunnel - it is the only route between the South Coast and the Santa Ynez Valley. Southbound you are descending; take the lane through the bore and run lights. Position approximate.</desc>
    <sym>Flag, Blue</sym>
    <type>info</type>
  </wpt>
