    <desc>Riders single this out: 'there are very few opportunities for water or food between Lompoc and Santa Barbara. The rest stop at Gaviota is the best place to water up.' Position approximate - it is on US-101 near the CA-1 junction. SRC rbw-owners-bunch cyclist thread</desc>
    <sym>Drinking Water</sym>
